{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"The three leading sponsor brands are **iShares (BlackRock), Vanguard, and SPDR (State Street)**.\n\nThe measurement is **ETF net assets at September 30, 2026, aggregated by sponsor brand within Lipper’s US ETF-for-sale universe**. It is not the sponsors’ worldwide ETF assets, total asset-management business, or a ranking of net inflows.\n\n**Worth knowing:** “US for sale” defines the covered distribution universe; it should not automatically be read as “all globally domiciled ETFs” or substituted with another provider’s US-listed ETF universe."}}
